{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q429876","formula":"HgO","hill":"HgO","elements":["O","Hg"],"composition":{"O":1.0,"Hg":1.0},"names":{"en":"Montroydite","uk":"Монтроїдит"},"descriptions":{"en":"Montroydite is the mineral form of mercury(II) oxide with formula HgO. It is a rare mercury mineral. It was first described for an occurrence in the mercury deposit at Terlingua, Texas and named for Montroyd Sharp who was an owner of the deposit. Montroydite occurs in mercury deposits of hydrothermal origin.","uk":"Монтроїдит — мінеральна форма оксиду ртуті(II) з формулою HgO, рідкісний мінерал ртуті. Вперше його було описано для прояву на родовищі ртуті в Терлінгві, штат Техас, і названо на честь Монтройда Шарпа, який був власником родовища. Монтроїдит зустрічається в родовищах ртуті гідротермального походження."},"fame":11,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"crystal","source":"materialsproject","ref":"mp-1224","atoms":8,"license":"CC BY 4.0, Materials Project"},"structure":{"cell":[[6.696,0.0,0.0],[0.0,5.564,0.0],[0.0,0.0,3.585]],"kind":"crystal","atoms":[{"x":4.118,"y":4.173,"z":2.675,"el":"Hg"},{"x":5.926,"y":1.391,"z":0.882,"el":"Hg"},{"x":2.578,"y":1.391,"z":0.91,"el":"Hg"},{"x":0.77,"y":4.173,"z":2.703,"el":"Hg"},{"x":5.78,"y":4.173,"z":0.296,"el":"O"},{"x":4.264,"y":1.391,"z":2.088,"el":"O"},{"x":0.916,"y":1.391,"z":3.289,"el":"O"},{"x":2.432,"y":4.173,"z":1.497,"el":"O"}],"bonds":[[1,5,1],[3,7,1],[2,5,1],[0,7,1]],"cellOrigin":[0,0,0]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q429876","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montroydite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%8